3                            =Total Number of Conductors (N+1)
0.254                        =Total Line Length (m)
1.0                          =Dielectric Constant of (Homogeneous) Medium
47                           =Number of Solution One-Way Time Delays
63                           =Number of Solution Points per Time Delay
2                            =Conductor Having Source Voltage (at near end)
2                            =Conductor Having Load Voltage (at far end)
1                            =Output Conductor for Terminal Voltages
1   1    50.0      50.0           =I,J,RS(I,J),RL(I,J)     (ohms)
1   2    0.0       0.0            =I,J,RS(I,J),RL(I,J)     (ohms)
2   2    50.0      50.0           =I,J,RS(I,J),RL(I,J)     (ohms)
